# Inference stack for curc/eval.py. sglang 0.4.8 matches the
# verlai/verl:app-verl0.5-sglang0.4.8 image used on Modal; compile with
#   uv pip compile curc/requirements.in --exclude-newer 2025-06-25T00:00:00Z \
#       --python-version 3.11 -o curc/requirements.lock
# so its unpinned deps resolve as they did when 0.4.8 shipped (newer
# compressed-tensors needs transformers>=4.53, but sglang pins 4.52.3).
